# THE GENRE MOVES (0.16.20, DJ MOVES' third knob): the auto-DJ (16 bars of groove) plays a round its genre's way. The dice are told which move
# (mvforce), one round each: a double drop (8 bars in, a fill, one bar down, the drop again, the same round), a fake drop (the build's end falls back
# into a breakdown, two bars, a build, the real drop), a riddim (halfway, four bars of the drums and the bass alone), no breakdown (one bar of it).
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 3
wait 100
expect fxpage 35
spin K3 2
wait 50
expect fxs98 2
shot moves_page.png
tap FX
wait 200
# DOUBLE DROP
mvforce 4
press GLO
tapkey 24
release GLO
expect djon 1
waitfor mv 4 6000
expect djround 0
waitfor sec 1 30000
wait 300
expect djround 0
waitfor sec 0 5000
wait 300
expect mv 0
expect djround 0
# the groove again (the same round), then its breakdown, build and drop: a round done; the next one a fake drop
mvforce 3
waitfor sec 1 60000
waitfor sec 2 40000
waitfor sec 0 30000
wait 300
expect djround 1
# FAKE DROP: the build's end falls straight back into a breakdown, the round not done
waitfor mv 3 6000
waitfor sec 1 60000
waitfor sec 2 40000
waitfor sec 1 30000
wait 300
expect djround 1
expect mv 0
# two bars down, a build, the real drop; the next round a riddim
waitfor sec 2 10000
mvforce 5
waitfor sec 0 30000
wait 300
expect djround 2
# RIDDIM: halfway through the groove, the pad, the acid and the pluck out for four bars (the throw going in)
waitfor mv 5 6000
waitfor mvm 224 40000
wait 100
expect entrkmute 224
tap HOME
wait 200
shot moves_riddim.png
tap HOME
wait 200
waitfor mvm 0 15000
wait 100
expect entrkmute 0
# NO BREAK, the next round: a single bar of breakdown, then the build
mvforce 1
waitfor sec 1 60000
waitfor sec 2 40000
waitfor sec 0 30000
waitfor mv 1 6000
waitfor sec 1 60000
waitfor sec 2 5000
# stopped: nothing of the moves left
mvforce -1
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect mv 0
expect mvm 0
